  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pursuing Pastoral Resilience (PPR) through improved animal health service delivery in pastoral areas of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved food security and improved resilience to drought (and other natural disasters) in the pastoral lowland communities of Ethiopia. As well to reduced morbidity and mortality due to PPR and SGP among the small ruminant population owned by the pastoralist communities of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </description>
